  "solution": "Solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven equation: 7 × 7 ÷ 8 - 12 × 6 + 17 - 14 - 100 = ?\n\nAfter interchanging '+' and '-' and '÷' and '×'\n\n__**7 ÷**____** 7**__ × 8 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ - 17 + 14 + 100 = ?\n\n⇒ __**1 ×**____** 8**__ + 2 - 17 + 14 + 100 = ?\n\n⇒ __**8 +**____** 2**__ - 17 __**+**____** 14 +**____** 100**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**124 - 17**__ = 107.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\"**.",
